2	line	Necrovarus	You dare to speak that name in this place?????
2	line	Player	She wants to pass-
2	line	Necrovarus	Silence!! Or I will incinerate the flesh from your bones!!!
2	line	Player	But she-
2	line	Necrovarus	Get out of my sight!! Or I promise you that you will regret your insolence for the rest of eternity!!!
2	action	end
