0	section	Returning to Velorina after talking to Necrovarus
1	cond	If the player is not wearing the amulet of ghostspeak:
2	action	above
1	cond	If the player is wearing the amulet of ghostspeak:
2	line	Player	I'm sorry, but Necrovarus will not let you go.
2	line	Velorina	I feared as much. His spirit is a thing of fire and wrath.
2	line	Player	You spoke of another way.
2	line	Velorina	It is only a small chance. During the building of the Ectofuntus one of Necrovarus's disciples spoke out against him. It is such a long time ago I cannot remember her name, although I knew her as a friend.
2	line	Velorina	She fled before the Ectofuntus took control over us, but being a disciple of Necrovarus she would have been privy to many of his darkest secrets. She may know of a way to aid us without Necrovarus.
2	select	Select an option
2	option	Do you know where this woman can be found?
3	line	Player	Do you know where this woman can be found?
3	line	Velorina	I have a vision of a small wooden shack, the land it was built on the unholy soil of Morytania. I sense the sea is very close, and that there are loomsSupposed to be loom castles to the west and the east.
3	action	end
2	option	If it was such a long time ago, won't she be dead already?
3	line	Player	If it was such a long time ago, won't she be dead already?
3	line	Velorina	She was a friend of mine. Had she died, I would have felt her spirit pass over to the next world, though I may not follow.
3	action	end
