0	section	Talking to the Old crone
1	line	Player	Were you once a disciple of Necrovarus in the Temple of Phasmatys, old woman?
1	line	Old crone	I don't remember; I am so old and my memory goes back only so far...
1	line	Player	Is there anything that can help to refresh your memory?
1	line	Old crone	Yes, I would love a nice hot cup of nettle tea.
1	cond	If the player already has a bowl of nettle tea:
2	line	Player	Here's some tea for you, like you asked.
2	line	Old crone	Yes, but it's not in my special cup! I only ever drink from my special cup!!
2	line	Player	I see. Can I have this special cup, then?
2	box	The old crone gives you her special cup.
2	action	
2	action	end
1	cond	If the player does not already have a bowl of nettle tea:
2	line	Player	Do you know where I can find nettles around here?
2	line	Old crone	I believe they grow wild in the Haunted Forest.
2	action	end
1	cond	If the player has regular nettle tea:
2	line	Player	Here's a lovely cup of tea for you, in your own special cup.
2	line	Old crone	Oh no, it hasn't got milk in it. I only drink tea with milk, I'm afraid.
2	action	end
1	cond	If the player has nettle tea with milk:
2	line	Player	Here's a lovely cup of milky tea for you, in your own special cup.
2	box	As the old woman drinks the cup of milky tea, enlightenment glows from within her eyes.
2	line	Old crone	Ah, that's better. Now, let me see... Yes, I was once a disciple of Necrovarus.
2	line	Player	I have come from Velorina. She needs your help.
2	line	Old crone	Velorina? That name sounds familiar...
2	line	Old crone	Yes, Velorina was once a very good friend! It has been many years since we spoke last. How is she?
2	line	Player	She's a ghost, I'm afraid.
2	line	Old crone	They are all dead, then. Even Velorina. I should have done something to stop what was happening, instead of running away.
2	line	Player	She and many others want to pass on into the next world, but Necrovarus will not let them. Do you know of any way to help them?
2	line	Old crone	There might be one way...
2	line	Old crone	Do you have such a thing as a ghostspeak amulet?
2	cond	If the player does not have a ghostspeak amulet in their bag:
3	line	Player	No I don't, I'm afraid.
3	line	Old crone	Well, you'll need to find one.
3	action	continue
2	cond	If the player has a ghostspeak amulet in their bag:
3	line	Player	Yes, I'm carrying one in my bag.
3	line	Old crone	Well, that's a stroke of luck.
3	action	continue
2	cond	If the player is wearing the ghostspeak amulet:
3	line	Player	Yes, I'm wearing one right now.
3	line	Old crone	Well, that's a stroke of luck.
2	line	Old crone	There is an enchantment that I can perform on such an amulet that will give it the power of command over ghosts. It will work only once, but it will enable you to command Necrovarus to let the ghosts pass on.
2	line	Player	What do you need to perform the enchantment?
2	line	Old crone	Necrovarus had a magical robe for which he must have no more use. Only these robes hold the power needed to perform the enchantment.
2	line	Old crone	All his rituals came from a book written by an ancient sorcerer from the East called Haricanto. Bring me this strange book.
2	select	Select an option
2	option	You are doing so much for me - is there anything I can do for you?
3	line	Player	You are doing so much for me - is there anything I can do for you?
3	line	Old crone	I have lived here on my own for many years, but not always. When I left Port Phasmatys, I took my son with me. He grew up to be a fine boy, always in love with the sea.
3	line	Old crone	He was about twelve years old when he ran away with some pirates to be a cabin boy. I never saw him again.
3	line	Player	That's the second saddest story I have heard today.
3	line	Old crone	If you ever see him, please give him this...and tell him that his mother still loves him.
3	box	The old woman gives you a toy boat.
3	action	
3	line	Player	Was this his boat?
3	line	Old crone	Yes, he made it himself. It is a model of the very ship in which he sailed away. The paint has peeled off and it has lost its flag, but I could never throw it away.
3	line	Player	If I find him, I will pass it on.
3	action	end
2	option	Remind me - what can I do about Necrovarus?
3	line	Player	Remind me - what can I do about Necrovarus?
3	line	Old crone	Do you have such a thing as a ghostspeak amulet?
3	cond	If the player doesn't have the ghostspeak amulet:
