0	section	Talking to Ak-Haranu
1	line	Player	It's nice to see a human face around here.
1	line	Ak-Haranu	My name Ak-Haranu. I am trader, come from many far across sea in east.
1	line	Player	You come from the lands of the East? Do you have anything that can help me translate a book that is scribed in your language?
1	line	Ak-Haranu	Ak-Haranu may help you. A translation manual I have, much good for reading Eastern language.
1	line	Player	How much do you want for it?
1	line	Ak-Haranu	Ak-Haranu not want money for this book, as is such small thing. But there may be something you could do for me. I am big admirer of Robin, Master Bowman. He staying in village inn.
1	line	Player	What would you like me to do?
1	line	Ak-Haranu	Please get Master Bowman sign an oak longbow for me, so Ak-Haranu can show family and friends when returning home and become much admired. Then I give you book in exchange.
1	select	Select an option
1	option	Okay, wait here - I'll get you your bow.
2	line	Player	Okay, wait here - I'll get you your bow.
2	action	end
1	option	Sorry, I have too much to do at the moment.
2	line	Player	Sorry, I have too much to do at the moment.
2	action	end
