5	line	Player	I've had enough of you not paying up - you owe me 100 gold coins. I'm going to tell the ghosts what you're doing.
5	line	Robin	Please don't do that!!! They will suck the life from my bones!!!
5	line	Player	How about you signing my longbow then?
5	line	Robin	Yes, anything!!!
5	box	Robin signs the oak longbow for you.
