5	action	end
3	option	How do you play Runedraw?
4	line	Player	How do you play Runedraw?
4	line	Robin	Two players take turns to draw a rune from a bag, which contains ten runes in total. Each rune has a different value: an air rune is worth one point, up to a Nature rune which is worth nine points.
4	line	Robin	If a player draws the Death rune then the game is over, and they have lost.
4	line	Robin	A player can choose to hold if they wish and not draw any more runes, but this runs the risk of the other player drawing more runes until they have a greater points total and win.
4	action	end
3	option	No, that doesn't sound fun.
4	line	Player	No, that doesn't sound fun.
4	action	end
