3	line	Ghost innkeeper	Yes, actually, I do. We have a very famous Master Bowman named Robin staying with us at the moment. Could you take him some clean bed linen for me?
3	option	Yes, I'd be delighted.
4	line	Player	Yes, I'd be delighted.
4	line	Ghost innkeeper	Oh, thank you. Be careful with that Robin, though - he's far too full of himself, that one.
4	action	end
4	action	
