0	section	Talking to Necrovarus whilst collecting signatures
1	cond	If the player does not have the amulet of ghostspeak:
2	action	above
1	cond	If the player has the amulet of ghostspeak:
2	cond	If the player also has the petition form (not signed or partially signed) in their inventory:
3	line	Player	I must let you know, Necrovarus, that I am collecting signatures from the citizens of Port Phasmatys.
3	line	Necrovarus	Oh, I do admire an activist. Do let me know when you're finished, and I'll give it my fullest consideration.
3	action	end
2	cond	If the player has a full petition form in their inventory:
3	line	Player	Necrovarus, I am presenting you with a petition form that has been signed by 10 citizens of Port Phasmatys.
3	line	Necrovarus	A petition you say? Continue, mortal.
3	line	Player	It says that the citizens of Port Phasmatys should have the right to choose whether they pass over into the next world or not, and not have this decided by the powers that be on their behalf.
3	line	Necrovarus	I see.
3	line	Player	So you will let them pass over if they wish?
3	line	Necrovarus	Oh yes.
3	line	Player	Really?
3	line	Necrovarus	NO!!!!! Get out of my sight before I burn every ounce of flesh from your bones!!!!!
3	box	The petition form turns to ashes in your hand.
3	action	
3	box	In his rage, Necrovarus drops a key on the floor.
3	action	end
