2	line	Necrovarus	You dare to face me again - you must be truly insane!!!!
2	line	Player	No, Necrovarus, I am not insane. With this enchanted amulet of ghostspeak I have the power to command you to do my will!
2	select	What do you want to command Necrovarus to do?
