3	line	Player	Let any ghost who so wishes pass on into the next world.
3	box	A beam of intense green light radiates out from the amulet of ghostspeak, enveloping Necrovarus in its power. His eyes become softer, and appear to stare into nothingness.
3	line	Necrovarus	I - will - let ...
3	line	Player	Carry on...
3	line	Necrovarus	... any ...
3	line	Player	Yes?
3	line	Necrovarus	... ghost who so wishes ...
3	line	Player	I think we're almost getting there...
3	line	Necrovarus	... pass into the next world.
3	action	end
