0	section	Talking to Necrovarus after freeing Port Phasmatys
1	line	Player	Told you I'd defeat you, Necrovarus. My advice to you is to pass over to the next world yourself with everybody else.
1	line	Necrovarus	I should fry you for what you have done...
1	line	Player	Quiet, evil priest!! If you try anything I will command you again, but this time it will be to throw yourself into the Endless Void for the rest of eternity.
1	line	Necrovarus	Please no! I will do whatever you say!!
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to Velorina
1	line	Velorina	You don't need to tell me {player} - I sensed the removal of Necrovarus's psychic barrier!
1	line	Player	Only happy to help out.
1	line	Velorina	Here, take this as a thank you for the service that you have given us.
1	box	Velorina gives you a vial of bright green ectoplasm.
1	line	Velorina	This is an Ectophial. If you ever want to come back to Port Phasmatys, empty this on the floor beneath your feet, and you will be instantly teleported to the temple - the source of its power.
1	line	Velorina	Remember that once the Ectophial has been used you need to refill it from the Ectofuntus.
1	action	end
0	section	Post-quest dialogue
0	section	Velorina
1	select	Select an option
1	option	I thought you were going to pass over to the next world.
2	line	Player	I thought you were going to pass over to the next world.
2	line	Velorina	All in good time, {player}. We stand forever in your debt, and will certainly put in a good word for you when we pass over.
2	action	end
1	option	Can I have another Ectophial?
